    <string name="settings_gpu_title">Graphics acceleration</string>
    <string name="settings_gpu_text">Linux programs draw on the phone\'s Adreno GPU (OpenGL 4.6, OpenGL ES 3.2, Vulkan 1.4) instead of the processor. The drivers come with HandTop and set themselves up. Programs that were open during a change need a restart.</string>
